### META
directory_path: testsuite/module_webui
last_updated: 2025-11-28T15:00:00Z
description: WebUI tests for DINS - validates FastAPI backend, frontend assets, section discovery, and Docker configuration.
notes: Tests the WebUI without requiring a running server. All tests are read-only.
---

### FILE
file_name: test_module_webui.py
file_type: executable
language_or_format: python
role: Main test file containing all WebUI tests. Implements run_tests(config) function required by test suite.
used_by:
  - testsuite.py
depends_on:
  - testsuite.py (for ModuleResult, TestResult classes)
status: active
notes: Can also be run standalone with --verbose flag for debugging.

functions:
  - name: run_tests
    description: Main entry point - runs all WebUI tests and returns ModuleResult
  - name: test_webui_directory_exists
    description: Validates WebUI base directory exists
  - name: test_backend_structure
    description: Checks required backend files
  - name: test_frontend_structure
    description: Checks required frontend files
  - name: test_app_py_syntax
    description: Validates app.py Python syntax
  - name: test_sections_exist
    description: Ensures at least one section exists
  - name: test_backend_sections_complete
    description: Validates backend section files
  - name: test_frontend_sections_complete
    description: Validates frontend section files
  - name: test_section_json_valid
    description: Validates section.json structure
  - name: test_routes_have_router
    description: Checks routes.py defines routers
  - name: test_docker_files_exist
    description: Validates Docker configuration files
  - name: test_frontend_html_valid
    description: Basic HTML validation
  - name: test_manifest_exists
    description: Checks WebUI Manifest file
  - name: test_section_count_matches
    description: Ensures backend/frontend section parity
